# Architecture Validated

The system is intentionally designed around:

```text
Transactional Outbox
        +
At-Least-Once Event Delivery
        +
Idempotent Consumer
        +
Kafka acks=all
        +
Replication Factor = 3
        +
min.insync.replicas = 2
        +
Retry Policy
        +
Dead Letter Topic
```

The combination protects against two opposite failure modes:

```text
Kafka unavailable before publication
→ Outbox prevents event loss
```

and:

```text
same event delivered more than once
→ Idempotent Consumer prevents duplicate business effects
```
